<title>UK: Cofinoga adds 500 mln French francs to 11-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Cofinoga adds 500 mln French francs to 11-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque de Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COFINOGA</p>
<p> AMT   *1.49 BLN FRF  COUPON     6.60 PCT  MATURITY    18.OCT.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.96    PAY DATE  **13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    100.66    SPREAD	+43 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 23.SEP.96 FOR 990 FRF.</p>
<p>	     **PLUS 0.47 ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K)  5</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE 2006 AND 2008 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
